          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நிகழ்தகவு — nikaḻtakavu — \"probability\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நாளை மழை பெய்வதற்கான நிகழ்தகவு அதிகம். nāḷai maḻai peyvataṟkāṉa nikaḻtakavu atikam. The probability of rain tomorrow is high."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A word of mathematics; everyday speech says வாய்ப்பு, chance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நிகழ்தகவு (nikaḻtakavu) is a modern native coinage: nikaḻ, \"to happen, occur\" (DEDR 3661), and takavu, \"fitness, proportion\", from taku (DEDR 3005): the measure of happening."
            }
          ]
        },
